==============================================================================
  Mutation tests  (assertion-strength validation)
==============================================================================

  Strategy: replace each named fact's body with `{}` (no constraint),
  then re-run Alloy. Each listed assertion should now FAIL on the
  mutated model. If it still PASSes, the assertion is vacuous and
  must be strengthened.

  - MUTATE F_PermissionEnforced  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_PermissionEnforced.als
    rationale: Removing the fact lets a successful operation occur without the (role, kind) being licensed by PermMatrix.Allowed. The injection forces a customer to successfully POST a decision, which LeastPrivilege and FR_015 forbid.
    expected to FAIL: LeastPrivilege, FR_015_StaffOnlyDecisions
      - LeastPrivilege: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_015_StaffOnlyDecisions: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AuditAppendOnly  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_AuditAppendOnly.als
    rationale: Removing the fact lets two events share the same (application, eventType) pair — the structural signature of an UPDATE/replace masquerading as an append. The injection forces such a duplicate to exist.
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, FR_016_AuditTrail, FR_017_RetentionAppendOnly
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_016_AuditTrail: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_017_RetentionAppendOnly: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AuditCompleteness  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_AuditCompleteness.als
    rationale: Without this fact, a decided application can exist with no corresponding decision event. The injection produces an Approved application that has zero approved events.
    expected to FAIL: AuditCompleteness, FR_016_AuditTrail
      - AuditCompleteness: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_016_AuditTrail: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_NoLeakageOnUnauthorisedRead  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_NoLeakageOnUnauthorisedRead.als
    rationale: Removing the fact lets a customer who probes another customer's reference receive PermissionDenied — a side channel revealing that the resource exists. The injection forces precisely that leaky outcome.
    expected to FAIL: NoInformationLeakage
      - NoInformationLeakage: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_OnePendingPerCustomer  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_OnePendingPerCustomer.als
    rationale: Without this fact, a single customer can hold multiple in-flight applications. The injection forces two distinct Pending Review applications to share one customer.
    expected to FAIL: FR_005_OnePendingPerCustomer
      - FR_005_OnePendingPerCustomer: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AtMostOneDecisionPerApplication  → runs/A-L1/mutated_F_AtMostOneDecisionPerApplication.als
    rationale: Without this fact, two staff members can both have their decisions recorded against the same application (the SC-005 race). The injection forces two distinct decisions for one application.
    expected to FAIL: FR_012_OnlyOneDecision, FR_017_RetentionAppendOnly
      - FR_012_OnlyOneDecision: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_017_RetentionAppendOnly: FAIL (expected)

